        <div class="pkg-help-row"><b>扩展名</b><span>html htm css js mjs json txt md xml csv map svg png jpg jpeg gif webp avif ico bmp woff woff2 ttf otf wav mp3 ogg m4a flac mp4 webm mov wasm（白名单之外拒绝安装）</span></div>
